      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Since the set last ran",
      "description": "How long since the frozen evaluation set ran for this agent. CI runs it on every push, so a figure measured in days means CI has stopped running it — which is the failure mode a gate has that nobody notices, because the build stays green.",
