    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Grounding verdicts",
      "description": "Per agent, per verdict. **NOT_REQUIRED is its own series on purpose.** An agent moving into it is an exemption somebody granted in `core.ai_agent`, with a written reason, and it should be as visible on this page as a rise in failures — a check that has been switched off for an agent looks identical to a check that is passing if the two are added together.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dthcms-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dthcms-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (agent_code, verdict) (rate(dthcms_ai_grounding_checked[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent_code}} · {{verdict}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "What the check caught, by arm",
      "description": "CITATION is a model ignoring the instruction to cite — usually a prompt problem. NUMBER and DATE are a model inventing — usually a model problem. DRUG is a name nothing in this system can verify, and **until CP75 supplies a formulary every drug name a model writes lands here**, which is why this series may be the largest one on the page and why that is not a surprise.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
