    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens the check examined",
      "description": "**The denominator, and the panel that stops this dashboard lying.** A clean grounding rate produced by a check that examined nothing is indistinguishable from a healthy system on every other panel here. If these series go flat while answers are still being produced, the check has stopped looking — a renamed prose field, a fact index that no longer decodes — and nothing else on this page would show it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dthcms-prometheus"
